            "review_title": "Review at CUA TƯƠI TRÀ VINH",
            "review_text": "Wanderer53118566940\n5 contributions\n0\nGood\nMar 2026 • Friends\nCame here with a group of friends. Food is delicious with fresh seafood. We had the crab meat salad with prawns, crab cooked in tamarind sauce, and the fried crab roll. Recommend this 3 dishes as it was filled with fresh crab meat and prawns especially the nem cuon.\n\nThe place is clean and service is good. If you want tasty local seafood, definitely worth a visit.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nReservations are highly recommended, as the availability of wild-caught crab is limited and depends on the daily catch.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 16, 2026",
